Monolayer BN - MF/Inteqp
============================

In this directory we perform a non-self-consistent (NSCF) mean-field
calculation at a specified path in the Brillouin zone to produce a
bandstructure plot.


Instructions
------------

  1. Take a look at the input file ``inp``. What is the path in k-space?

  2. Run ``./01-calculate_wfn.qsub`` to calculate the wavefunctions on the
     specified path. This should take about 3 mins.
